WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.740
If your prep is MiraLAX, this video will walk you through exactly how to take

2
00:00:03.740 --> 00:00:03.840
it.

3
00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:06.080
Just follow along step by step.

4
00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:10.700
For this prep, you'll need a few items, all available over the counter, no

5
00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:11.600
prescription needed.

6
00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:16.160
You'll need one 238-gram bottle of MiraLAX powder,

7
00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:21.040
two to four Dulcolax laxative tablets, and 64 ounces of a clear sports drink

8
00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:21.840
like Gatorade,

9
00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:26.460
Propel, or Crystal Light. That's usually two 32-ounce bottles. If you have

10
00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:26.720
diabetes,

11
00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:32.010
use sugar-free Gatorade G2. Also, make sure you get the laxative tablets, not

12
00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:33.040
the stool softener.

13
00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:38.560
One important rule, your sports drink cannot be red, orange, blue, or purple.

14
00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:43.390
Stick to clear or light-colored flavors. The day before your colonoscopy, you

15
00:00:43.390 --> 00:00:44.240
'll start by mixing

16
00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:48.860
the solution. Pour the entire bottle of MiraLAX into a pitcher with all 64

17
00:00:48.860 --> 00:00:49.840
ounces of the sports

18
00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:54.070
drink. Stir or shake until the powder is completely dissolved. You can chill it

19
00:00:54.070 --> 00:00:55.040
in the refrigerator

20
00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:59.620
if you'd like, keeping it cold makes it easier to drink. Now for part one, the

21
00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:00.160
evening before your

22
00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:04.780
procedure. At 4pm, take your Dulcolax tablets with a glass of water. Your

23
00:01:04.780 --> 00:01:06.080
doctor's instructions

24
00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:09.500
will tell you whether to take two or four. Follow their guidance on the

25
00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:11.440
specific amount. At 5pm,

26
00:01:11.440 --> 00:01:15.840
you'll start drinking the first half of the solution. That's 32 ounces. Drink

27
00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:16.320
an eight ounce

28
00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:21.010
glass every 15 minutes until that half is gone. Keep drinking clear liquids

29
00:01:21.010 --> 00:01:22.320
after you finish.

30
00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:26.880
For part two, six hours before your colonoscopy, you'll drink the second half,

31
00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:27.440
which is another

32
00:01:27.440 --> 00:01:32.560
32 ounces. Drink this at the same pace, an eight ounce glass every 15 minutes.

33
00:01:32.560 --> 00:01:34.240
You can continue to

34
00:01:34.240 --> 00:01:38.230
have clear liquids up until four hours before your procedure. This part is

35
00:01:38.230 --> 00:01:39.360
really important.

36
00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:43.190
You must drink all of the prep solution as directed, even if you're already

37
00:01:43.190 --> 00:01:44.080
passing clear

38
00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:48.670
liquid. I know it can feel like enough, but finishing the entire dose is what

39
00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:49.120
gives us the

40
00:01:49.120 --> 00:01:53.680
clearest view during your procedure. If the prep isn't completed as directed,

41
00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:54.960
we may need to reschedule,

42
00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:58.780
and neither of us wants that. Please drink plenty of liquids throughout the

43
00:01:58.780 --> 00:01:59.840
process to prevent

44
00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:04.390
dehydration. Staying hydrated will help you feel better and help the prep do

45
00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:04.880
its job.

46
00:02:04.880 --> 00:02:09.760
If you experience any discomfort from frequent trips to the bathroom, applying

47
00:02:09.760 --> 00:02:10.640
a petroleum-based

48
00:02:10.640 --> 00:02:15.760
ointment or diaper rash cream can really help. That's it. You've got this.

49
00:02:15.760 --> 00:02:17.520
Follow the timing,

50
00:02:17.520 --> 00:02:21.660
finish the full dose, and stay hydrated. If you have any questions at all, don

51
00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:22.320
't hesitate to

52
00:02:22.320 --> 00:02:24.720
call our office. We're here to help.
